<title>USA: Nu-kote Holdings says 10K filing delayed.</title>
<headline>Nu-kote Holdings says 10K filing delayed.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nu-kote Holdings said Tuesday it will file its report on Form 10-K for the fiscal year ended March 31 when a final agreement about a new credit facility is signed.</p>
<p>Last week, Nu-Kote announced it had entered into an agreement with a consortium of banks to provide a credit facility for the company.</p>
<p>Due to the delay in filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, Nu-kote said its ticker symbol on Nasdaq is now followed by an E.</p>
<p>The E will be removed when the Form 10-K is filed.</p>
</text>
